# Rolling into the foot of the lab's 3-stair from below: its risers are 17 cm, low enough for a curb
# hop, but a tread is 35 cm deep (under ground.curbHopDepth), so stairs are not rolled up: the skater
# stops against the first riser, as before (ollie them).
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 16 4 0.13 0
cmd 6 speed 4
run 200
expect no event bump
expect skater.pos.y < 7.3 at end
